g-tight uppercase\" data-kid=\"243\">May Dental Wave</h3>\n                    <div class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#0FFFFF]/30 text-[#0FFFFF] text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"244\">ID: 8820-AA</div>\n                  </div>\n                  <p class=\"text-[10px] font-archivo text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"245\">Global dental outreach. Model: <b data-kid=\"246\">Priya v3.1</b></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"247\">\n                  <button class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white font-archivo text-[10px] font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition-all flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"248\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-download\" data-kid=\"249\"></i> Export\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-5 space-y-6\" data-kid=\"252\">\n                \n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\" data-kid=\"253\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5\" data-kid=\"254\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[9px] font-archivo text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\" data-kid=\"255\">Engaged</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\" data-kid=\"256\">\n                      <h5 class=\"text-xl font-sora font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"257\">5,142</h5>\n                      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#10b981]\" data-kid=\"258\">62.7%</span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5\" data-kid=\"259\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[9px] font-archivo text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\" data-kid=\"260\">Appts</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\" data-kid=\"261\">\n                      <h5 class=\"text-xl font