ation-1000 neon-text-cyan\" data-kid=\"282\">Holographic Data Projection</span>\n                   </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"283\">\n                  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"284\">\n                    <h5 class=\"text-white font-sora font-bold uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"285\">Recent Conversions</h5>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-archivo uppercase\" data-kid=\"286\">Showing top 5 of 984</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-black/30 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"287\">\n                    <table class=\"w-full text-left font-archivo text-sm\" data-kid=\"288\">\n                      <thead data-kid=\"289\">\n                        <tr class=\"bg-white/5 text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-white/5\" data-kid=\"290\">\n                          <th class=\"px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"291\">Lead Detail</th>\n                          <th class=\"px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"292\">Status</th>\n                          <th class=\"px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"293\">Engage</th>\n                          <th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-right\" data-kid=\"294\">Result</th>\n                        </tr>\n                      </thead>\n                      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-white/5\" data-kid=\"295\">\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-white/[0.04] border-l-2 border-transparent hover:border-l-[#0FFFFF] transition-all cursor-pointer group\" data-kid=\"296\">\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"297\">\n                            <p class=\"text-white font-bold group-hover:text-[#0FFFFF] transition-colors text-xs\" data-kid=\"298\">Rahul Sharma</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"299\">+91 98765 43210</p>\n                          </td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"300\">\n                            <span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/10 text-green-500 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase\" data-kid=\"301\">Ans</span>\n                          </td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-slate-400 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"302\">1m 42s</td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-right font-bold text-white uppercase text-[10px] tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"303\">Booked</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-white/[0.04] border-l-2 border-transparent hover:border-l-[#0FFFFF] transition-all cursor-pointer group\" data-kid=\"304\">\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"305\">\n                            <p class=\"text-white font-bold group-hover:text-[#0FFFFF] transition-colors text-xs\" data-kid=\"306\">Sarah Jenkins</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"307\">+1 415 555 0122</p>\n                          </td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"308\">\n                            <span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/10 text-green-500 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase\" data-kid=\"309\">Ans</span>\n                          </td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-slate-400 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"310\">3m 12s</td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-right font-bold text-white uppercase text-[10px] tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"311\">Booked</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-white/[0.04] border-l-2 border-transparent hover:border-l-[#0FFFFF] transition-all cursor-pointer group\" data-kid=\"312\">\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"313\">\n                            <p class=\"text-white font-bold group-hover:text-[#0FFFFF] transition-colors text-xs\" data-kid=\"314\">Amit Patel</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"315\">+91 99887 76655</p>\n                          </td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"316\">\n                            <span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/10 text-yellow-500 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase\" data-kid=\"317\">VM</span>\n                          </td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-slate-400 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"318\">45s</td>\n                          <td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-right font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"319\">Follow</td>\n                        </tr>\n                      </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</div>\n",
